# tools/install-tlaps.sh compares what it installed with this file; scripts/proof_sync.py compares
# the prover each proof results file prints with it.
# The release tag floats: 1.6.0-pre is a pre-release that GitHub rebuilds under the same name, so a
# fresh install may not yield this binary. A results file made by another build cites another prover,
# and moving this pin is the record of that.
